    <sys:String x:Key="SettingsExifToolDesc">If file time calibration was not enabled during earlier uploads, or you find some files have inaccurate timestamps, use this tool to scan the media files in the main library and write the EXIF capture time to the OS-level file creation and modification times, fixing sorting issues in Windows Photos and third-party cloud drives.</sys:String>
