    <sys:String x:Key="AppWizardStep1Title">Step 1 · Set an app password</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="AppWizardStep1Hint">Set an app password. It is used to verify your identity when unlocking the app; archived media can only be accessed after successful verification. This step only records input; nothing has changed yet.</sys:String>

    <sys:String x:Key="AppWizardStep2Title">Step 2 · Choose folders to protect</sys:String>
