    <sys:String x:Key="AppWizardStep3Title">Step 3 · Confirm</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="AppWizardExplainLock">Once confirmed, the selected folders are locked immediately: neither Explorer nor PicHarbor can read or write them until you unlock. Note: this is a system-level lock on the folders, not encryption; data can still be read after reinstalling the system or if the drive is removed. (It is sufficient for everyday security — if you need stronger protection, consider encrypting the volume yourself.)</sys:String>
